-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ג/11 (20.8.2023): תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר
-- לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ג.
-- The one-time grant to upper-division teachers of the schools whose
-- achievements ranked highest in תשפ"ג: who is covered, the amounts by the
-- school's rank, part-time and part-year shares, when it is paid, and how it
-- is treated for other pay, the study fund and the pension fund.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in this file is counted in salary MONTHS of the school year
-- (common.l4): August 2023 is 12, September 2023 is 13.
`August 2023`    MEANS 12
`September 2023` MEANS 13

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ג/11`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date, reference number, circular number, addressee (the owners of educational institutions), greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 The source: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 between the local-authorities centre and the three large cities and the secondary teachers' organization, approved by the wage commissioner ("ההסכם"), with provisions on Oz LaTmura and on all upper-division teaching staff.

-- ¶15: the circular publishes the grant for teaching employees employed in
-- תשפ"ג by owners of post-primary education in the upper divisions, under
-- section 36 of the agreement.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the agreement section the grant rests on` MEANS "section 36 of the collective agreement of 14.8.2011"

§§ `1 תחולה`

@desc An upper-division teaching employee's school year תשפ"ג, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `circular 11 teacher` HAS
    `graded in the teaching employees' grading`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of supervised post-primary education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `upper-division position fraction`                     IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held in the upper division (1 = 100%)
    `school rank`                                          IS A `school rank` @desc the rank the Ministry gave the school's achievements
    `share of the year employed at the school`             IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of תשפ"ג the teacher was employed at the excellent school, counting maternity leave (and not unpaid leave after it) as employed
    `on full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc on sabbatical or unpaid leave for the whole of תשפ"ג

-- Section 1: every employee graded as a teaching employee in the upper
-- division and employed by an owner of supervised post-primary education,
-- by the share of employment in the upper division, in Oz LaTmura or not.
@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN t IS A `circular 11 teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` t IF
        t's `graded in the teaching employees' grading`
    AND t's `employed by an owner of supervised post-primary education`
    AND t's `upper-division position fraction` GREATER THAN 0

§§ `2 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- akn:art_2 The heading of section 2; no rule.

-- 2א: the programme rewarding teachers for achievements (learning, social,
-- values) in the upper divisions (grades 9-12/14 or 10-12/14) runs from
-- תשע"ג under the format of the pedagogic administration's letter of
-- 21.10.2012; who ranks where is that format's, an input here.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
DECLARE `school rank` IS ONE OF
    `rank 1, the highest 10%`
    `rank 2, the next 10%`
    `rank 3, the next 10%`
    `rank 4, the next 10%`
    `not ranked`

-- 2ב: the teachers of the upper divisions the Ministry found highest in
-- achievement are entitled to a one-time grant. The table (¶2-¶10), for a
-- teacher at 100% of a position, updated to May 2023; the corpus carries it
-- as lines of prose, and each amount is read with the rank beside it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9 akn:art_2__para_b/p10
GIVEN r IS A `school rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position grant for` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `rank 1, the highest 10%` THEN 9197.31
    WHEN `rank 2, the next 10%` THEN 6897.99
    WHEN `rank 3, the next 10%` THEN 4598.66
    WHEN `rank 4, the next 10%` THEN 3448.98
    WHEN `not ranked` THEN 0

-- ¶11: the amounts were updated by the consumer price index of May 2023
-- against May 2022; the base amounts and the indices are not printed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p11
GIVEN `amount at May 2022` IS A NUMBER @desc the grant's amount at the May 2022 index (not printed in this circular)
      `index of May 2023`  IS A NUMBER
      `index of May 2022`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the indexed amount` `amount at May 2022` `index of May 2023` `index of May 2022` IS
    `amount at May 2022` TIMES (`index of May 2023` DIVIDED BY `index of May 2022`)

-- 2ג: part-time and/or part of the year (sabbatical or unpaid leave for part
-- of it included; maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law counts
-- as employed, unpaid leave after it does not) — the proportional part, by
-- the upper-division position fraction and the share of תשפ"ג employed at
-- the excellent school; both apply where both are partial.
-- 2ג ¶2: on full sabbatical or unpaid leave for all of תשפ"ג — no grant.
-- 2ד: employment above 100% is not counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_c/p2 akn:art_2__para_d
GIVEN t IS A `circular 11 teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant share` t IS
    IF t's `on full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`
    THEN 0
    ELSE min (t's `upper-division position fraction`) 1
         TIMES t's `share of the year employed at the school`

@export The one-time school-achievement grant (תגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר) an upper-division teacher is owed for תשפ"ג under circular תשפ"ג/11
GIVEN t IS A `circular 11 teacher` @desc the teacher's year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the achievement grant` t IS
    IF `the circular applies to` t
    THEN `the full-position grant for` (t's `school rank`) TIMES `the grant share` t
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `circular 11 action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `include the grant in another base` HAS `base` IS A STRING
    `deposit pension contributions on the grant` HAS `employer share` IS A NUMBER, `employee share` IS A NUMBER

-- 2ה: paid with August 2023's salary and no later than September 2023's.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN t IS A `circular 11 teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 11 action`
DECIDE `payment of the achievement grant` t IS
    IF `the achievement grant` t GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay the achievement grant` `amount paid`
               PROVIDED `amount paid` AT LEAST `the achievement grant` t
         WITHIN `September 2023`
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשפ\"ג/11 2ה: the grant is paid no later than September 2023's salary"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 2ו: not part of the base for the hour value, severance pay or percentage
-- supplements; no study-fund contributions on it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f
`the bases the grant is kept out of` MEANS
    LIST "the hour value", "severance pay", "percentage supplements", "study-fund contributions"

@ref akn:art_2__para_f
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 11 action`
DECIDE `the grant stays out of other bases` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `include the grant in another base` `which base`
          PROVIDED elem `which base` `the bases the grant is kept out of`
    WITHIN `September 2023`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשפ\"ג/11 2ו: the grant is not part of the hour value, severance or percentage-supplement base, and no study-fund contributions are made on it"

-- 2ז: pension-fund contributions are made on the grant: 5% from the
-- employer, and 5% deducted from the teacher's pay.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g
`the employer's pension contribution rate` MEANS 0.05
`the teacher's pension contribution rate`  MEANS 0.05

GIVEN t IS A `circular 11 teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 11 action`
DECIDE `pension contributions on the grant` t IS
    IF `the achievement grant` t GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `deposit pension contributions on the grant` `employer part` `employee part`
               PROVIDED `employer part` AT LEAST (`the achievement grant` t TIMES `the employer's pension contribution rate`)
                    AND `employee part` AT LEAST (`the achievement grant` t TIMES `the teacher's pension contribution rate`)
         WITHIN `September 2023`
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשפ\"ג/11 2ז: 5% employer and 5% employee pension contributions are made on the grant"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `3-4`

-- akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p2 A link to the post-primary division's page with the programme's details and the list of winning schools; the list itself is not in the circular, so a school's rank is an input.

DECLARE `reimbursement channel` IS ONE OF
    `the payments system under subject 583 in August 2023's payments`

-- Section 4: the owners are reimbursed in the payments system under subject
-- 583, in August 2023's payments transferred at the start of 9/2023.
@ref akn:art_4
`how the owners are reimbursed` MEANS `the payments system under subject 583 in August 2023's payments`

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off, the signatories and the list of copies; no rule.

-- Examples. The teachers are made up; the amounts are the circular's.
GIVEN `fraction` IS A NUMBER, `rank` IS A `school rank`, `year share` IS A NUMBER, `on leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `circular 11 teacher`
DECIDE `a teacher at` `fraction` `rank` `year share` `on leave` IS
    `circular 11 teacher` WITH
        `graded in the teaching employees' grading`             IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of supervised post-primary education` IS TRUE
        `upper-division position fraction`                     IS `fraction`
        `school rank`                                          IS `rank`
        `share of the year employed at the school`             IS `year share`
        `on full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`              IS `on leave`

#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `rank 1, the highest 10%` 1 FALSE) EQUALS 9197.31
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1.2 `rank 2, the next 10%` 1 FALSE) EQUALS 6897.99
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 0.5 `rank 3, the next 10%` 1 FALSE) EQUALS 2299.33
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `rank 4, the next 10%` 0.5 FALSE) EQUALS 1724.49
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `rank 1, the highest 10%` 0 TRUE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `not ranked` 1 FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 0 `rank 1, the highest 10%` 1 FALSE) EQUALS 0

#TRACE `payment of the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `rank 1, the highest 10%` 1 FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 9197.31 AT 12
#TRACE `payment of the achievement grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `rank 1, the highest 10%` 1 FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 9197.31 AT 14
#TRACE `pension contributions on the grant` (`a teacher at` 1 `rank 1, the highest 10%` 1 FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `deposit pension contributions on the grant` 459.87 459.87 AT 12
#TRACE `the grant stays out of other bases` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `include the grant in another base` "severance pay" AT 12
